builderTools.legend.CaveBrush.Page1.Title = [TMP] 洞穴筆刷
builderTools.legend.CaveBrush.Page1.Description = [TMP] 洞穴筆刷工具允許您製作洞穴與峽谷。
builderTools.legend.CaveBrush.Page1.DecorateArea = [TMP] 在您瞄準處新增洞穴裝飾
